{"lesson": {"id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44", "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44", "chapter": null, "section": null, "number": "44", "title": "二次方程的根的公式", "printed_title": "44. 二次方程的根的公式", "start_page": 258, "start_printed": 252, "figures": [], "exercise_count": 15, "prose": [{"kind": "p", "text": "我们已经学过通过配出二项式的平方来解二次方程。\n每次这样求解，都需要进行较繁琐的变形。\n因此，我们先解一般形式的二次方程，推导出求根公式，以后就能直接用公式求解。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#7"], "source_text": "我们学习了用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程. 但是这种方法需要作烦琐的变形. 因此，先求出一般形式的二次方程的解，引出根的公式，今后再按照这个公式解二次方程就比较方便.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "先考虑方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#8"], "source_text": "为了求解方程", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，\n其中 $a\\neq0$， （1）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#9"], "source_text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，　其中 $a\\neq0$，　（1）", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "把方程的每一项都除以 $a$，得到与它同解的方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#10"], "source_text": "我们用 $a$ 除它所有的项，得到和它同解的方程", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$. （2）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#11"], "source_text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$.　（2）", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "对三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配方，配出二项式的平方：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#1"], "source_text": "由三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配出二项式的平方：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#2"], "source_text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这样，方程（2）可以写成：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#3"], "source_text": "方程（2）具有下列形式：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$. （3）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#4"], "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$.　（3）", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程（3）与方程（1）同解，它们的根的个数取决于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的正负。\n因为 $a\\neq0$，所以无论 $a$ 取什么非零值，分母都为正。\n因此，只需看分子是正、是负，还是零，就能判断这个分式的符号。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#5"], "source_text": "方程（3）的根的个数，也就是方程（1）的根的个数决定于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的符号. 因为 $a\\neq0$，所以当 $a$ 是任何数时，分式的分母是正的，于是，分式的符号由它的分子的符号确定.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "用字母 $D$ 表示 $b^2-4ac$，方程（3）就可以写成", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#6"], "source_text": "我们用字母 $D$ 表示式 $b^2-4ac$，并且把方程（3）写成", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#7"], "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "1）设 $D<0$。\n这时，分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 为负，无论 $x$ 取什么值，表达式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 都为正。\n所以，方程（3）没有根，与它同解的方程（1）也没有根。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#8"], "source_text": "1）设 $D<0$. 那么分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是负的，而当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是正的. 于是，在这种情况下，方程（3）没有根，也就是和它同解的方程（1）没有根.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "2）设 $D=0$。\n这时，方程（3）变为：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#9"], "source_text": "2）设 $D=0$. 那么方程（3）具有下列形式：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#10"], "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这个方程只有一个根 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$，与它同解的方程（1）也只有这个根。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#11"], "source_text": "所得到的方程，也就是和它同解的方程（1）有唯一的根$-\\frac{b}{2a}$.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "3. 设 $D>0$。\n把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：\n$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$.\n\n于是，方程（1）与下面的方程同解：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#1"], "source_text": "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解：", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#2"], "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "分解因式，得到", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#3"], "source_text": "就是", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#4"], "source_text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因此，至少有一个因式为零：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#5"], "source_text": "由此得：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$ 或 $x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#6"], "source_text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "分别解这两个一次方程，得到", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#7"], "source_text": "就是", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 或 $x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#8"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "所以，方程（1）的两个根是：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#9"], "source_text": "方程（1）有两个根：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 和 $\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#10"], "source_text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "把这两个根合写为：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#11"], "source_text": "可采用下面的简便写法：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，\n其中 $D=b^2-4ac$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#12"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这就是二次方程的求根公式。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#13"], "source_text": "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "二次方程是否有根、共有几个根，都取决于表达式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值。\n这个表达式叫作二次方程的判别式。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#14"], "source_text": "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判别式.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "归纳起来，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；\n当 $D=0$ 时，方程只有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；\n当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：\n$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 和 $\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#15", "p0261#1"], "source_text": "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，它有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "求根公式也适用于 $D=0$ 的情况。\n当 $D=0$ 时，公式变为：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#2"], "source_text": "我们发现，二次方程的根的公式可以用于 $D=0$ 的情形.实际上，当 $D=0$ 时，公式具有下面的形式：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#3"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这两个符号选择给出同一个结果：\n$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#4"], "source_text": "由此得　　$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因此，求根公式适用于任何有根的二次方程。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#5"], "source_text": "因此，二次方程的根的公式适用于任何有根的二次方程.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "下面用几个例子说明怎样利用求根公式解二次方程。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#6"], "source_text": "我们来看利用上面推出的公式求解二次方程的例子.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 1 解方程 $12x^2+7x+1=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#7"], "source_text": "例 1　解方程　$12x^2+7x+1=0$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这个方程的系数是 $a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#8"], "source_text": "在这个方程里，$a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "先计算判别式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#9"], "source_text": "求出判别式：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#10"], "source_text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "判别式为正，所以方程有两个根。\n代入求根公式，得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#11"], "source_text": "因为判别式是正的，那么方程有两个根，这两个根可以利用二次方程的根的公式求出：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#12"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "分别取负号和正号，得到", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#13"], "source_text": "由此得", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，\n$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#14"], "source_text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，　$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "所以，方程的解集是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#15"], "source_text": "方程的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 2 解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#1"], "source_text": "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "系数为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，因此", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#2"], "source_text": "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#3"], "source_text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程只有一个根：\n$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#4"], "source_text": "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 3 解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#5"], "source_text": "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "系数为 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#6"], "source_text": "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "判别式为 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$.\n判别式为负，所以方程没有根。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#7"], "source_text": "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别式是负的，所以方程没有根.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "对于 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$，即使系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 中有一个为零，也可以用求根公式求解。\n系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个为零的二次方程，叫作不完全二次方程。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#8"], "source_text": "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次方程.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全二次方程。\n第一个方程的系数为 $a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$；\n第二个方程的系数为 $a=1$，$b=0$，$c=-1.21$；\n\n第三个方程的系数为 $a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#9"], "source_text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.", "changes": ["wording", "math-correction", "layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "现在用求根公式解不完全二次方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#10"], "source_text": "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#11"], "source_text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "先求判别式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#12"], "source_text": "得到：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#13"], "source_text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，\n$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#14"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "不过，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这两类不完全二次方程时，像前面那样把方程左边分解因式，往往更方便。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#15", "p0263#1"], "source_text": "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左边分解因式的方法更方便.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例如，把方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 的左边分解因式，得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#2"], "source_text": "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#3"], "source_text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#4"], "source_text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，就是 0.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#5"], "source_text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "有时，把求根公式换一种写法，计算会更方便。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#6"], "source_text": "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比较方便.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母都除以 2，再把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移入根号，得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#7"], "source_text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号下面. 得到：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#8"], "source_text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "由 $D=b^2-4ac$，可得 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，也就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#9"], "source_text": "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因此，求根公式可以写成：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#10"], "source_text": "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是：", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，\n其中 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#11"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这种写法适用于判别式非负的任何二次方程（如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）。\n当 $b$ 是偶数，也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数时，常用这种写法。", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#12"], "source_text": "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式.", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例如，求解方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#13"], "source_text": "举例说，假设需要解方程", "changes": ["wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#14"], "source_text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这里 $\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，$a=9$，$c=5$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#15"], "source_text": "这里　　$\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，　$a=9$，　$c=5$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#16"], "source_text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#1"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$ 或 $x=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#2"], "source_text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$　或　$x=1$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#3"], "source_text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.", "changes": [], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}], "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1", "edition": "modern-us-neutral", "status": "draft", "source": {"path": "lessons/alg7-c4-s3-n44/lesson.json", "sha256": "f58b51513a87fc4f1bd8a20d7cd8717eec6614c4342f5bc70879d80b87dc068d", "data": {"id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44", "card_id": "alg7-c4-s3-n44", "chapter": null, "section": null, "number": "44", "title": "二次方程的根的公式", "printed_title": "44. 二次方程的根的公式", "start_page": 258, "start_printed": 252, "figures": [], "exercise_count": 15, "prose": [{"kind": "p", "text": "我们学习了用配出二项式的平方的方法解二次方程. 但是这种方法需要作烦琐的变形. 因此，先求出一般形式的二次方程的解，引出根的公式，今后再按照这个公式解二次方程就比较方便.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "为了求解方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$ax^2+bx+c=0$，　其中 $a\\neq0$，　（1）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们用 $a$ 除它所有的项，得到和它同解的方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=0$.　（2）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 252, "source_refs": ["p0258#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "由三项式 $x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$ 配出二项式的平方：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}=x^2+2x\\cdot\\frac{b}{2a}+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2+\\frac{c}{a}=\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程（2）具有下列形式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#3"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}=0$.　（3）", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#4"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程（3）的根的个数，也就是方程（1）的根的个数决定于分式 $\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a^2}$ 的符号. 因为 $a\\neq0$，所以当 $a$ 是任何数时，分式的分母是正的，于是，分式的符号由它的分子的符号确定.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#5"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们用字母 $D$ 表示式 $b^2-4ac$，并且把方程（3）写成", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#6"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "1）设 $D<0$. 那么分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是负的，而当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 的值是正的. 于是，在这种情况下，方程（3）没有根，也就是和它同解的方程（1）没有根.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "2）设 $D=0$. 那么方程（3）具有下列形式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "所得到的方程，也就是和它同解的方程（1）有唯一的根$-\\frac{b}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 253, "source_refs": ["p0259#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "就是", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#3"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#4"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "由此得：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#5"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#6"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "就是", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程（1）有两个根：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "可采用下面的简便写法：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#12"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#13"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判别式.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#14"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，它有一个根，等于 $-\\frac{b}{2a}$；当 $D>0$ 时，方程有两个根：$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 254, "source_refs": ["p0260#15", "p0261#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们发现，二次方程的根的公式可以用于 $D=0$ 的情形.实际上，当 $D=0$ 时，公式具有下面的形式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#3"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "由此得　　$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#4"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因此，二次方程的根的公式适用于任何有根的二次方程.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#5"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们来看利用上面推出的公式求解二次方程的例子.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#6"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 1　解方程　$12x^2+7x+1=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "在这个方程里，$a=12$，$b=7$，$c=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "求出判别式：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=7^2-4\\times12\\times1=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因为判别式是正的，那么方程有两个根，这两个根可以利用二次方程的根的公式求出：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{1}}{24}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#12"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "由此得", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#13"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x_1=\\frac{-7-1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{3}$，　$x_2=\\frac{-7+1}{24}=-\\frac{1}{4}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#14"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{4}\\right\\}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 255, "source_refs": ["p0261#15"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#3"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#4"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#5"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#6"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别式是负的，所以方程没有根.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次方程.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，$b=0$，$c=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x^2-1.21=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#12"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#13"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#14"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左边分解因式的方法更方便.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 256, "source_refs": ["p0262#15", "p0263#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "举例说，对于方程 $x^2-1.21=0$ 得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$(x+1.1)(x-1.1)=0$，", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#3"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#4"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程 $7x^2=0$ 只有一个根，等于 0.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#5"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "解二次方程时，有时利用写成另一种形式的根的公式比较方便.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#6"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "把分式 $\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ 的分子和分母除以 2 并且把因数 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 移到根号下面. 得到：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#7"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{D}}{a}=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#8"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "因为 $D=b^2-4ac$，所以 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4}=\\frac{b^2}{4}-ac$，就是 $\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#9"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "二次方程的求根公式可以写成下面的形式，就是：", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#10"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{-\\frac{b}{2}\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{D}{4}}}{a}$，其中　$\\frac{D}{4}=\\left(\\frac{b}{2}\\right)^2-ac$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#11"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "写成这种形式的公式，可以用来解判别式不是负值的任何二次方程（显然，如果 $D\\geq0$，那么 $\\frac{D}{4}\\geq0$）. 实际上，在 $b$ 是偶数（也就是 $\\frac{b}{2}$ 是整数）的情况下，常常运用这个公式.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#12"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "举例说，假设需要解方程", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#13"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$9x^2-14x+5=0$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#14"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "这里　　$\\frac{b}{2}=-7$，　$a=9$，　$c=5$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#15"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{D}{4}=(-7)^2-9\\times5=4$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 257, "source_refs": ["p0263#16"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{7\\pm\\sqrt{4}}{9}$", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#1"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "$x=\\frac{5}{9}$　或　$x=1$.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#2"]}, {"kind": "p", "text": "方程的根是 $\\frac{5}{9}$ 和 1.", "id": null, "label": null, "printed_page": 258, "source_refs": ["p0264#3"]}]}}, "section_breaks": [], "errata": [{"id": "p0262-math-1", "target": "lesson.prose[53]", "source": {"page": 262, "printed_page": 256, "block": "p0262#9", "sha256": "916b6e0ea925f1de9c3ee40c0493906e07ed7a9c7f713d1969bf31aafc6597cb", "pdf_sha256": "8070c333ee46fb0dc650cb32d4d898f605ed308559b6cc430425d908dae6b052"}, "original": "$c=1.21$", "corrected": "$c=-1.21$", "reason": "原页例3印出方程 x^2-1.21=0，却在系数行印出 c=1.21；同例判别式计算又使用 (-1.21)。按 ax^2+bx+c=0 的定义，常数项应为 -1.21。独立源审已确认原印正号，忠实原式不改，仅允许现代层补负号，现代内容独审仍待完成。"}]}, "exercises": {"lesson": "alg7-c4-s3-n44", "count": 15, "exercises": [{"number": "858", "source_number": "858", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "858. 下列方程都已写成 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式。指出系数 $a$、$b$、$c$，计算判别式，并说明方程有几个根：\na) $2x^2+3x+1=0$；\nb) $3x^2+7x+2=0$；\nc) $2x^2+x+1=0$；\nd) $4x^2+4x+1=0$；\ne) $x^2+5x-6=0$；\nf) $x^2+2x+2=0$；\ng) $9x^2-6x+1=0$；\nh) $4x^2-7x-2=0$.", "lines": ["858. 下列方程都已写成 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式。指出系数 $a$、$b$、$c$，计算判别式，并说明方程有几个根：", "a) $2x^2+3x+1=0$；", "b) $3x^2+7x+2=0$；", "c) $2x^2+x+1=0$；", "d) $4x^2+4x+1=0$；", "e) $x^2+5x-6=0$；", "f) $x^2+2x+2=0$；", "g) $9x^2-6x+1=0$；", "h) $4x^2-7x-2=0$."], "pages": ["p0264#4"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "858. 在下列 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 这种形式的方程里，说出系数$a$，$b$，$c$. 计算判别式并指出方程根的个数：а) $2x^2+3x+1=0$；　б) $3x^2+7x+2=0$；в) $2x^2+x+1=0$；　г) $4x^2+4x+1=0$；д) $x^2+5x-6=0$；　е) $x^2+2x+2=0$；ж) $9x^2-6x+1=0$；　з) $4x^2-7x-2=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "859", "source_number": "859", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "859. 用求根公式解下列方程：\na) $3x^2-7x+4=0$；\nb) $5x^2-8x+3=0$；\nc) $3x^2-13x+14=0$；\nd) $2y^2-9y+9=0$；\ne) $5y^2-6y+1=0$；\nf) $4x^2-x-33=0$；\ng) $3z^2+32z+80=0$；\nh) $x^2+7x-60=0$；\ni) $y^2-10y-24=0$；\nj) $p^2+p-90=0$.", "lines": ["859. 用求根公式解下列方程：", "a) $3x^2-7x+4=0$；", "b) $5x^2-8x+3=0$；", "c) $3x^2-13x+14=0$；", "d) $2y^2-9y+9=0$；", "e) $5y^2-6y+1=0$；", "f) $4x^2-x-33=0$；", "g) $3z^2+32z+80=0$；", "h) $x^2+7x-60=0$；", "i) $y^2-10y-24=0$；", "j) $p^2+p-90=0$."], "pages": ["p0264#5"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "859. 利用公式解下列方程：а) $3x^2-7x+4=0$；　б) $5x^2-8x+3=0$；в) $3x^2-13x+14=0$；　г) $2y^2-9y+9=0$；д) $5y^2-6y+1=0$；　е) $4x^2-x-33=0$；ж) $3z^2+32z+80=0$；　з) $x^2+7x-60=0$；и) $y^2-10y-24=0$；　к) $p^2+p-90=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "860", "source_number": "860", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "860. 解下列方程：\na) $5x^2=9x+2$；\nb) $-x^2=5x-14$；\nc) $-x^2=6x+9$；\nd) $z-5=z^2-25$；\ne) $y^2=52y-576$；\nf) $15y^2-30=22y+7$；\ng) $25p^2=10p-1$；\nh) $2x^2-480=6-9x$.", "lines": ["860. 解下列方程：", "a) $5x^2=9x+2$；", "b) $-x^2=5x-14$；", "c) $-x^2=6x+9$；", "d) $z-5=z^2-25$；", "e) $y^2=52y-576$；", "f) $15y^2-30=22y+7$；", "g) $25p^2=10p-1$；", "h) $2x^2-480=6-9x$."], "pages": ["p0264#6"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "860. 解下列方程：а) $5x^2=9x+2$；　б) $-x^2=5x-14$；в) $-x^2=6x+9$；　г) $z-5=z^2-25$；д) $y^2=52y-576$；　е) $15y^2-30=22y+7$；ж) $25p^2=10p-1$；　з) $2x^2-480=6-9x$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "861", "source_number": "861", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "861. 把下列方程化为 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式，再求出所有的根：\na) $(x+4)^2=3x+40$；\nb) $(2x-3)^2=11x-19$；\nc) $(x+1)^2=7918-2x$；\nd) $(x+2)^2=3131-2x$.", "lines": ["861. 把下列方程化为 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式，再求出所有的根：", "a) $(x+4)^2=3x+40$；", "b) $(2x-3)^2=11x-19$；", "c) $(x+1)^2=7918-2x$；", "d) $(x+2)^2=3131-2x$."], "pages": ["p0264#7"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "861. 把下列方程化成 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式，并且求出它们的根：а) $(x+4)^2=3x+40$；　б) $(2x-3)^2=11x-19$；в) $(x+1)^2=7918-2x$；　г) $(x+2)^2=3131-2x$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "862", "source_number": "862", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "862. 查表求出下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：\na) $5x^2-x-1=0$；\nb) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；\nc) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；\nd) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$.", "lines": ["862. 查表求出下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：", "a) $5x^2-x-1=0$；", "b) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；", "c) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；", "d) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$."], "pages": ["p0265#1"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "862. 查表求下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：а) $5x^2-x-1=0$；　б) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；в) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；　г) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "863", "source_number": "863", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "863. 解下列方程：\na) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；\nb) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；\nc) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；\nd) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；\ne) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；\nf) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$.", "lines": ["863. 解下列方程：", "a) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；", "b) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；", "c) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；", "d) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；", "e) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；", "f) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#2"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "863. 解下列方程：а) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；　б) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；в) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；　г) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；д) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；　е) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "864", "source_number": "864", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？\na) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；\nb) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$.", "lines": ["864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？", "a) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；", "b) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$."], "pages": ["p0265#3"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？а) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；б) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "865", "source_number": "865", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "865. 分别用求根公式和把方程左边分解因式这两种方法，解下列不完全二次方程：\na) $12x^2+7x=0$；\nb) $x^2-25=0$.", "lines": ["865. 分别用求根公式和把方程左边分解因式这两种方法，解下列不完全二次方程：", "a) $12x^2+7x=0$；", "b) $x^2-25=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#4"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "865. 用两种方法（利用公式和把方程左边分解因式）解下列不完全的二次方程：а) $12x^2+7x=0$；　б) $x^2-25=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "866", "source_number": "866", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "866. 求使下列方程没有根的所有 $t$ 值组成的集合：\na) $3x^2-2x+t=0$；\nb) $5x^2+18x+t=0$；\nc) $4x^2+tx+1=0$；\nd) $48x^2+tx-5=0$.", "lines": ["866. 求使下列方程没有根的所有 $t$ 值组成的集合：", "a) $3x^2-2x+t=0$；", "b) $5x^2+18x+t=0$；", "c) $4x^2+tx+1=0$；", "d) $48x^2+tx-5=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#5"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "866. 设下列方程没有根，求 $t$ 值的集合：а) $3x^2-2x+t=0$；　в) $4x^2+tx+1=0$；б) $5x^2+18x+t=0$；　г) $48x^2+tx-5=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "867", "source_number": "867", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "867. 求使下列方程有两个根的所有 $v$ 值组成的集合：\na) $10x^2+40x+v=0$；\nb) $2x^2+vx+18=0$；\nc) $vx^2-6x+1=0$；\nd) $7x^2+vx-25=0$.", "lines": ["867. 求使下列方程有两个根的所有 $v$ 值组成的集合：", "a) $10x^2+40x+v=0$；", "b) $2x^2+vx+18=0$；", "c) $vx^2-6x+1=0$；", "d) $7x^2+vx-25=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#6"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "867. 设下列方程有两个根，求 $v$ 值的集合：а) $10x^2+40x+v=0$；　б) $2x^2+vx+18=0$；в) $vx^2-6x+1=0$；　г) $7x^2+vx-25=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "868", "source_number": "868", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "868. $k$ 取哪些值时，下列方程只有一个根？\na) $16x^2+kx+9=0$；\nb) $15x^2-90x+k=0$；\nc) $kx^2-100x+k=0$；\nd) $25x^2+kx+2=0$.", "lines": ["868. $k$ 取哪些值时，下列方程只有一个根？", "a) $16x^2+kx+9=0$；", "b) $15x^2-90x+k=0$；", "c) $kx^2-100x+k=0$；", "d) $25x^2+kx+2=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#7"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "868. $k$ 是什么数时，下列方程有一个根？а) $16x^2+kx+9=0$；　б) $15x^2-90x+k=0$；в) $kx^2-100x+k=0$；　г) $25x^2+kx+2=0$.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "869", "source_number": "869", "group": "复习题", "group_id": "g1", "text": "869. 对三项式配方，配出二项式的平方，再证明：\na) 无论变量取什么值，三项式 $a^2+12a+40$ 的值都为正；\nb) 无论变量取什么值，三项式 $a^2-6a+13$ 的值都不小于 4.", "lines": ["869. 对三项式配方，配出二项式的平方，再证明：", "a) 无论变量取什么值，三项式 $a^2+12a+40$ 的值都为正；", "b) 无论变量取什么值，三项式 $a^2-6a+13$ 的值都不小于 4."], "pages": ["p0265#9", "p0266#1"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "869. 由三项式配出二项式的平方以后，证明：а) 当变量取任何值时，三项式 $a^2+12a+40$ 的值是正数；б) 当变量取任何值时，三项式 $a^2-6a+13$ 的值不小于4.", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "870", "source_number": "870", "group": "复习题", "group_id": "g1", "text": "870.\na) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 与同一条直线上的点 $A'(x-3)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $C(-8)$、$D(6.5)$ 对应？点 $E(7)$、$F'(0)$ 分别与哪些点对应？证明这个规则给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射。\nb) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 与点 $A'(2x)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $B(5.5)$、$C(-8.25)$ 对应？点 $D'(10)$、$E'(-15)$ 分别与哪些点对应？证明这个规则给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射。是否存在一个点，映射后仍对应于它自身？\nc) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $M(x)$ 与点 $M'(x^2)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $A(1.5)$、$B(-1.5)$ 对应？是否存在与点 $C'(-1)$ 对应的点？这个规则给出了坐标直线到哪个集合上的映射？", "lines": ["870.", "a) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 与同一条直线上的点 $A'(x-3)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $C(-8)$、$D(6.5)$ 对应？点 $E(7)$、$F'(0)$ 分别与哪些点对应？证明这个规则给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射。", "b) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 与点 $A'(2x)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $B(5.5)$、$C(-8.25)$ 对应？点 $D'(10)$、$E'(-15)$ 分别与哪些点对应？证明这个规则给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射。是否存在一个点，映射后仍对应于它自身？", "c) 规定坐标直线上的每一点 $M(x)$ 与点 $M'(x^2)$ 对应。哪些点分别与 $A(1.5)$、$B(-1.5)$ 对应？是否存在与点 $C'(-1)$ 对应的点？这个规则给出了坐标直线到哪个集合上的映射？"], "pages": ["p0266#2"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "870. а) 使坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 和同一条直线上的点$A'(x-3)$ 相对应. 什么点和点 $C(-8)$、$D(6.5)$ 相对应？点 $E(7)$、$F'(0)$ 和什么点相对应？证明这种规定给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射.б) 使坐标直线上的每一点 $A(x)$ 和点 $A'(2x)$ 相对应.什么点和点 $B(5.5)$、$C(-8.25)$ 相对应？点 $D'(10)$、点$E'(-15)$ 和什么点相对应？证明这种规定给出了坐标直线到自身上的映射. 经过映射后，有一个点对应于它自身吗？в) 使坐标直线上的每一点 $M(x)$ 和点 $M'(x^2)$ 相对应.什么点和点 $A(1.5)$、点 $B(-1.5)$ 相对应？和点 $C'(-1)$相对应的点存在吗？这种规定表示坐标直线到什么集合上的映射？", "changes": ["layout", "wording"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "871", "source_number": "871", "group": "复习题", "group_id": "g1", "text": "871. 化简：\na) $(\\sqrt{21}+\\sqrt{14}-2\\sqrt{35})\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}+\\sqrt{20}$；\nb) $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{15})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3})+\\sqrt{75}$.", "lines": ["871. 化简：", "a) $(\\sqrt{21}+\\sqrt{14}-2\\sqrt{35})\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}+\\sqrt{20}$；", "b) $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{15})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3})+\\sqrt{75}$."], "pages": ["p0266#3"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [], "source_text": "871. 化简：а) $(\\sqrt{21}+\\sqrt{14}-2\\sqrt{35})\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}+\\sqrt{20}$；б) $(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{15})(\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3})+\\sqrt{75}$.", "changes": ["layout"], "numeric_changes": [], "historical_entities": []}, {"number": "872", "source_number": "872", "group": "复习题", "group_id": "g1", "text": "872. 证明：只要 $a\\neq0$，表达式 $\\left(a+\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^2-a^2$ 的值就一定大于 2.", "lines": ["872. 证明：只要 $a\\neq0$，表达式 $\\left(a+\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^2-a^2$ 的值就一定大于 2."], "pages": ["p0266#4"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": [],