+7$；", "ж) $25p^2=10p-1$；　з) $2x^2-480=6-9x$."], "pages": ["p0264#6"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "861", "source_number": "861", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "861. 把下列方程化成 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式，并且求出它们的根：а) $(x+4)^2=3x+40$；　б) $(2x-3)^2=11x-19$；в) $(x+1)^2=7918-2x$；　г) $(x+2)^2=3131-2x$.", "lines": ["861. 把下列方程化成 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式，并且求出它们", "的根：", "а) $(x+4)^2=3x+40$；　б) $(2x-3)^2=11x-19$；", "в) $(x+1)^2=7918-2x$；　г) $(x+2)^2=3131-2x$."], "pages": ["p0264#7"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "862", "source_number": "862", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "862. 查表求下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：а) $5x^2-x-1=0$；　б) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；в) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；　г) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$.", "lines": ["862. 查表求下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：", "а) $5x^2-x-1=0$；　б) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；", "в) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；　г) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$."], "pages": ["p0265#1"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "863", "source_number": "863", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "863. 解下列方程：а) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；　б) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；в) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；　г) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；д) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；　е) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$.", "lines": ["863. 解下列方程：", "а) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；　б) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；", "в) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；　г) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；", "д) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；　е) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#2"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "864", "source_number": "864", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？а) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；б) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$.", "lines": ["864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？", "а) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；", "б) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$."], "pages": ["p0265#3"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "865", "source_number": "865", "group": null, "group_id": "g0", "text": "865. 用两种方法（利用公式和把方程左边分解因式）解下列不完全的二次方程：а) $12x^2+7x=0$；　б) $x^2-25=0$.", "lines": ["865. 用两种方法（利用公式和把方程左边分解因式）解下列", "不完全的二次方程：", "а) $12x^2+7x=0$；　б) $x^2-25=0$."], "pages": ["p0265#4"], "figure_refs": [], "figures": []}, {"number": "866", "source_number": "866", "gr